我都吃辣麻味噌口味，這次我嚐鮮黑麻油拉麵\n.\n辣麻味噌拉麵是店內的招牌，湯頭非常濃郁，辣度可以調整，我點了微辣，剛剛好。辣椒和花椒的香氣非常濃郁，讓人忍不住一口接一口\n黑麻油拉麵的湯頭非常香濃，麻油香氣非常濃郁，讓人忍不住閉上眼睛享受。麵條吸附了湯汁，口感非常滑順。叉燒軟嫩多汁\n.\n覺得麵、菜、肉吃不夠可以再單點\n份量蠻多、價格親民，非常適合喜歡吃拉麵的朋友",null,[0,122]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18227955819507507232/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdPWEp4WmxOUkVBRRAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18227955819507507232/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdPWEp4WmxOUkVBRRAB"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/18227955819507507232/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdPWEp4WmxOUkVBRRAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18227955819507507232/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdPWEp4WmxOUkVBRRAB"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/18227955819507507232/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdPWEp4WmxOUkVBRRAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/18227955819507507232/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUkdPWEp4WmxOUkVBRRAB"]],[null,null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/@/data\u003d!4m7!23m6!1m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGOXJxZlNREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x474842340748731!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDF9rqfSQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGOXJxZlNREAE\u0026t\u003d3\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGOXJxZlNREi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJREY5cnFmeVFFEhNDZ3dJMVktbnFnWVFxSmlqcUFNIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARMYd0QCOEdAQqCzBfSFJVS3AxQmtj\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjIzZW68tSWAxUuQfUHHQS3Au8QoykInQIoBg"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwin9Zu68tSWAxWy5IsBHRpwDjsQ0pMFCM0BKA0"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjIzZW68tSWAxUuQfUHHQS3Au8Q0pMFCJECKAU"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4cGRQQVlBEAE",["0x0:0x474842340748731",null,1684740766205109,1684740766205109,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117062434194841339941/reviews?hl\u003